* text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.patch text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.jar binary
*.lzma binary
*.zip binary
*.pyd binary
*.cfg text eol=lf
*.jks binary

# Minecraft binary data — MUST stay binary. These are gzip streams; the
# catch-all `* text eol=lf` above normalizes CRLF inside the compressed
# bytes and destroys them irrecoverably on add/checkout.
*.nbt binary
*.mcstructure binary
*.schem binary
*.schematic binary
*.dat binary
*.mca binary
*.ogg binary